           <item>
            <widget class="QLabel" name="label_8_label">
             <property name="text">
              <string>&lt;b&gt;Existing files are replaced&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The output file is written in the folder of the PSG file, named after it with the suffix. A file with that name is replaced. Without a suffix, the output file of an EDF recording is its Snooz accessory file (.tsv), which is replaced by the extracted annotations.</string>
             </property>
