            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_output_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>The output file has these columns.&lt;br/&gt;• group is the category of the annotation, for example artifact. Annotations with different names can be in the same group.&lt;br/&gt;• name is the text label of the annotation, for example art_snooz.&lt;br/&gt;• start_sec is the onset of the annotation in seconds, for example 300.&lt;br/&gt;• duration_sec is the duration of the annotation in seconds, for example 30.&lt;br/&gt;• channels is the list of channels of the annotation, for example ['LOC', 'ROC'].&lt;br/&gt;• time elapsed (HH:MM:SS) is optional. It is the time elapsed since the start of the PSG recording.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
